  "bio": "Nestled in the heart of Barth, Germany, Kurstadt Ink emerges as a sanctuary for body art enthusiasts, specializing in intricate dotwork and elegant black & gray tattoos. This avant-garde studio, helmed by the renowned Robert Grafe, offers a unique blend of tattooing prowess and piercing artistry, all set within an atmosphere where creativity and precision meet.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Barth, Mecklenburg-vorpommern, Germany"
